<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT- M. Stanley starts Sapient.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT- M. Stanley starts Sapient.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley analyst David Togut started Sapient Corp with an outperform rating and set a target price at $58, the analyst's office said.</p>
<p>-- Togut estimated that Sapient would see earnings of $0.54 per share during 1996, $0.78 for 1997 and $1.15 for 1998, his office said.</p>
</text>
